  title="Nevara Cabinets Officially Launches: Frameless All-Plywood at a Lower Price Point"
  description="W.W. Wood formally launched Nevara on March 27, 2026: frameless, all-plywood construction, a streamlined SKU offering, an estimated 3–4 week lead time, and a dedicated Nevara multiplier. What changed, where to get the v2.0 spec book, and how to quote it."
  author="Ben Miller"
  publishedDate="2026-03-27"
